cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Two capitals, one chamber: Moroccan and Algerian positions in the United Nations, 1962-2025"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Mouhajir
    given-names: Souheil
    affiliation: "Elliott School of International Affairs, The George Washington University"
abstract: >-
  Roll call agreement, caucus defection, the Sahara votes and General Debate vocabulary
  of Morocco and Algeria in the United Nations, coded from 5,086 shared General Assembly
  roll calls between 1962 and 2020, 12 Security Council renewals of MINURSO between 2016
  and 2025, and 10,069 General Debate addresses between 1962 and 2024.
keywords:
  - Morocco
  - Algeria
  - United Nations General Assembly
  - roll call analysis
  - Western Sahara
  - text as data
